    "outcome-apply": "Decides what happens with each call an event makes.",
    "outcome-apply.calcs.call": "A call of the event, in order. A call with a condition that does not hold is skipped. Otherwise a call of the outside world is an effect, and a call of a component inside the system is made, unless that component was already changed in this step: then it is called twice in one step, which the specification must not do."
